    {
      "heading": "③ 最簡單的一個：$x^2$",
      "body": [
        "1. 寫差商",
        "2. 化簡：$(x+h)^2=x^2+2xh+h^2$",
        "3. 約掉 $h$：$\\dfrac{h(2x+h)}{h}=2x+h$",
        "4. 令 $h\\to0$：",
        "檢查：$x=1$ 得 $2$，$x=3$ 得 $6$，跟前兩課一樣"
      ],
      "tex": [
        "\\frac{(x+h)^2-x^2}{h}",
        "\\frac{x^2+2xh+h^2-x^2}{h}=\\frac{2xh+h^2}{h}",
        "\\frac{d}{dx}x^2=2x"
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "③ 展開與通分",
      "body": [
        "$(x+h)^3=x^3+3x^2h+3xh^2+h^3$",
        "檢查：$x=1$ 得 $3$，正是 2.2 算的 $y=x^3$ 在 $x=1$ 的切線斜率",
        "$\\frac1x$：通分（$x\\ne0$）",
        "檢查：$x=2$ 得 $-\\frac14$，跟 2.2 一樣"
      ],
      "tex": [
        "\\frac{(x+h)^3-x^3}{h}=\\frac{3x^2h+3xh^2+h^3}{h}",
        "=3x^2+3xh+h^2",
        "\\frac{d}{dx}x^3=\\lim_{h\\to0}(3x^2+3xh+h^2)=3x^2",
        "\\frac1{x+h}-\\frac1x=\\frac{x-(x+h)}{x(x+h)}=\\frac{-h}{x(x+h)}",
        "\\frac{-h}{x(x+h)}\\cdot\\frac1h=\\frac{-1}{x(x+h)}",
        "\\frac{d}{dx}\\frac1x=\\lim_{h\\to0}\\frac{-1}{x(x+h)}=-\\frac1{x^2}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "③ $\\sqrt x$：有理化",
      "body": [
        "（$x>0$）乘共軛 $\\sqrt{x+h}+\\sqrt x$：",
        "分子平方差：$(x+h)-x=h$",
        "檢查：$x=9$ 得 $\\frac16$，正是上一課認出來的 $f'(9)$",
        "為什麼要求 $x>0$？",
        "$x=0$：差商 $\\dfrac{\\sqrt h}{h}=\\dfrac1{\\sqrt h}\\to+\\infty$",
        "而且 $h<0$ 時 $\\sqrt h$ 沒有定義，只能從右邊來"
      ],
      "tex": [
        "\\frac{\\sqrt{x+h}-\\sqrt x}{h}\\cdot\\frac{\\sqrt{x+h}+\\sqrt x}{\\sqrt{x+h}+\\sqrt x}",
        "=\\frac{h}{h(\\sqrt{x+h}+\\sqrt x)}=\\frac1{\\sqrt{x+h}+\\sqrt x}",
        "\\frac{d}{dx}\\sqrt x=\\frac1{\\sqrt x+\\sqrt x}=\\frac1{2\\sqrt x}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "④ 四個結果，一個規律",
      "body": [
        "把結果都寫成 $x^n$ 的樣子：",
        "$\\def\\arraystretch{1.5}\\begin{array}{c|c|c}f(x) & n & f'(x)\\\\\\hline x^2 & 2 & 2x^1\\\\ x^3 & 3 & 3x^2\\\\ \\dfrac1x=x^{-1} & -1 & -1\\cdot x^{-2}\\\\ \\sqrt x=x^{1/2} & \\dfrac12 & \\dfrac12x^{-1/2}\\end{array}$",
        "$-\\frac1{x^2}=-x^{-2}$；$\\frac1{2\\sqrt x}=\\frac12x^{-1/2}$",
        "規律：次方拿到前面，次方減 $1$",
        "這就是冪次法則：下一課證明，以後不必每次用定義",
